      <h2>What N10-009 measures</h2>
      <p>
        Network+ combines design choices, implementation, routine operations, security, and troubleshooting. The largest domain is Network Troubleshooting, so preparation should include diagrams, commands, packet evidence, and fault isolation rather than definitions alone.
      </p>
